<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5; padding: 20px; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    h1 { color: #4b5563; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Your account has been deleted</h1>
    <p>Hi <strong><%= displayName %></strong>,</p>
    <p>We are writing to let you know that due to prolonged inactivity (about a year), your account has been automatically deleted from our system, along with all its associated data.</p>
    <p>Thank you for the time spent with us! If you ever want to resume your learning journey with flashcards, you are more than welcome to create a new account at any time.</p>
    
    <div class="footer">
      Have a great day,<br>The Flashcards Team
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>